pure-push corollary at the root system:  vol(1+eta) >= 8 + (1/3) sum [1-(1-eta_i)^4]
   200 random pushes, sum eta up to 0.9:  min(vol - bound) = +3.971e-06  (>= 0 required; 0 on one-centre rays)

the exact inequality with tilts:  vol >= vol(Q_w) + sum_i A_i (s_i/4)[1-(1-eta_i/s_i)^4]
   63 tilted packings: min(vol - bound) = +3.938e-06  (>= 0 required)
